Subject: [PATCH] r1os: exempt r1d and its agent box from four neverallows (ADR-0035)

r1os's core daemon (r1d, a system_ext domain) runs its own binary and libraries from /data/r1os,
and its agent box runs an Alpine userland and the claude/codex CLIs from there. To build the box,
r1d mounts a private /proc, /tmp, /dev and devpts, and it reads and fixes up the agent user's
files as root. AOSP's neverallows forbid all of that outside a few platform domains.

Two private attributes (the pattern of update_provider) exempt them:
 - r1os_data_exec, on r1os's executable file types in /data: the two data-execution neverallows.
   Only r1d and r1d_agent have rules that execute them.
 - r1os_privileged, on r1d: the filesystem-mount and dac_override/dac_read_search neverallows.

Applied by r1os's tools/build-image.sh (stage `layer`) on android-15.0.0_r36.
---
diff --git a/private/attributes b/private/attributes
--- a/private/attributes
+++ b/private/attributes
@@ -31,3 +31,17 @@
 until_board_api(202504, `
     attribute tee_service_type;
 ')
+
+# r1os (its ADR-0035): r1d, r1os's core daemon (a system_ext domain), builds the agent box: a private
+# mount namespace with its own /proc, /tmp, /dev and devpts, and the agent user's files, which it
+# reads and fixes up as root. Like vold's and zygote's, that needs the mount and dac_override
+# exemptions in domain.te. Only for r1os's own images.
+attribute r1os_privileged;
+expandattribute r1os_privileged false;
+
+# r1os (its ADR-0035): file types in /data/r1os that may hold executable code: r1d and its libraries
+# (deployed there, not baked into the image, during development) and the agent box's Alpine userland
+# and CLIs. Exempt from domain.te's data-execution neverallows; only r1d and the agent box's domain
+# have rules that execute them, and neither can write the other's.
+attribute r1os_data_exec;
+expandattribute r1os_data_exec false;
diff --git a/private/domain.te b/private/domain.te
--- a/private/domain.te
+++ b/private/domain.te
@@ -1836,6 +1836,7 @@
     -vendor_file_type
     -exec_type
     -postinstall_file
+    -r1os_data_exec # r1os: r1d's and its agent box's code in /data/r1os (attributes)
 }:file execute;
 
 # Only init is allowed to write cgroup.rc file
@@ -1908,6 +1909,7 @@
   -dalvikcache_data_file
   -system_data_file # shared libs in apks
   -apk_data_file
+  -r1os_data_exec # r1os: r1d's and its agent box's code in /data/r1os (attributes)
 }:file no_x_file_perms;
 
 # Minimize dac_override and dac_read_search.
@@ -1925,6 +1927,7 @@
   migrate_legacy_obb_data
   netd
   postinstall_dexopt
+  r1os_privileged
   recovery
   rss_hwm_reset
   sdcardd
@@ -1959,6 +1962,7 @@
     -init
     -kernel
     -otapreopt_chroot
+    -r1os_privileged # r1os: r1d mounts the agent box's /proc, /tmp, /dev and devpts (attributes)
     -recovery
     -update_engine
     -vold
